      "instance_name": "anti_black_racism",
      "label": "Anti-Black Racism",
      "description": "The meme functions as a hateful caricature that reinforces anti-Black racism by visually mapping the children's appearance and activity onto the offensive term 'sea monkeys'. This stereotype is rooted in historical racial prejudice and aims to demean and dehumanize Black people based on their race.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
