      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "historical_racial_prejudice",
      "label": "Historical Racial Prejudice",
      "description": "The use of the term 'sea monkeys' to refer to Black people is a manifestation of historical racial prejudice that has been used to dehumanize and demean Black individuals. This prejudice has deep roots in colonialism, slavery, and systemic racism, and continues to influence harmful stereotypes today.",
